{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22992","headline":"庐山草堂夜雨独宿寄牛二李七庾三十二员外 · 白居易","name":"庐山草堂夜雨独宿寄牛二李七庾三十二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹霄携手三君子，白发垂头一病翁。\n兰省花时锦帐下，庐山雨夜草庵中。\n终身胶漆心应在，半路云泥迹不同。\n唯有无生三昧观，荣枯一照两成空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}